                note: "USB D+ of the built-in USB Serial/JTAG controller (ROM download, boot log, default JTAG). Any other function on GPIO12 or GPIO13 disables it (esp-hal clears USB_PAD_ENABLE) and the port vanishes from the PC: to flash over USB again, hold GPIO9 low (GPIO8 high) through a CHIP_PU reset. D+ fluctuates at power-up; an external pull-up holds it high.",
            ),
